// A sunmote (the space arc): a mote that lives on sunlight, a sunstone
// spark in a dark shell on pale, veined wings. Space's bats, and worse:
// they come in packs, fast, diving in from every side (no wall out here to
// put your back to) and peeling away; their touch is cold, drinking your
// warmth. One's a nuisance; a pack of eight is a fight. Fire can't hurt
// them (they eat it); frost does.
